✅ 了解！已按照你的規則調整：
規則：
	•	VERIFY = 0 且 BSA = 1 → 當成沒事（OK）
	•	其他情況不一樣（尤其是 VERIFY = 1 但 BSA = 0 或 NULL）→ 視為問題（DIFF）
最終推薦查詢
-- 【最終推薦】只顯示真正有問題的差異
SELECT 
    a.CustomerNo,
    a.CIF_KEY,
    ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) AS BSA_IsSARFiled,
    ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) AS VERIFY_IsSARFiled,
    CASE 
        WHEN ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 0 AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1 
            THEN 'OK (VERIFY 0, BSA 1)' 
        WHEN ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) 
            THEN 'OK'
        ELSE 'DIFF *** 需要處理 ***'
    END AS Compare_Result
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b 
    ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 
    FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c 
    WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
-- 只顯示真正有問題的
AND NOT (ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 0 AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1)   -- 排除可接受的情況
AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) <> ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0)
ORDER BY a.CustomerNo;

統計版（快速看問題嚴重程度）
SELECT 
    COUNT(*) AS Total_Problem_Cases,
    SUM(CASE WHEN ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1 AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS VERIFY_1_BSA_0,
    SUM(CASE WHEN ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1 AND a.IsSARFiled IS NULL THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS VERIFY_1_BSA_NULL
FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON a.cif_key = b.cif_key
WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP c WHERE a.CIF_KEY = c.NEW_CIF_KEY)
AND ISNULL(b.IsSARFiled, 0) = 1 
AND ISNULL(a.IsSARFiled, 0) = 0;     -- 只抓 VERIFY=1 但 BSA≠1 的問題

這個版本完全符合你的需求：
	•	VERIFY=0、BSA=1 → 不會出現（視為沒事）
	•	VERIFY=1、BSA=0 或 NULL → 會被標記為 DIFF，需要處理
